@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5165

GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

## ============================================
## ENTRY PARKING - TICKET GENERATION
## ============================================

### Entry Parking - Generate Ticket (Success)
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/entry-parking/entry-ticket
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "plate_number": "AB1234CD",
    "vehicle_type_id": 1,
    "gate": "Gate Main"
}

###

